@startuml
title UC-01 - Application creation and Environment Secret Store (V06 design)
autonumber
actor Developer as Dev
boundary SettingsController as API
control ApplicationService as Apps
control EnvironmentSettingsService as Settings
control ConfigurationService as Config
database UnitOfWork as DB
participant SecretStoreResolver as Stores
Dev -> API: CreateApplication(name, subdomain)
API -> Apps: Validate/create identity and two Environments
Apps -> DB: Atomic create + empty Sets, no defaults or runtime
DB --> Dev: Application identity + Environment metadata
Dev -> API: Load Environment Settings
API --> Dev: Secret Store, version and safe operation state
Dev -> API: Change secret store(expectedVersion, configVersion)
API -> Settings: Scoped validation and atomic operation claim
Settings -> Config: Copy immutable desired Secrets
Config -> Stores: Resolve scoped credentials and copy/verify
Settings -> DB: Commit store/revision under owner + versions
DB --> Dev: New metadata/version or safe stale/busy/copy error
note over API,DB
No deployment Connection/profile/region selector or transition entry.
Preview/Deploy target resolution belongs to UC-05/06/08.
Network calls outside transactions; no secret bytes in public views.
Per-resource original pins remain authoritative across restart/cleanup.
end note
@enduml
